        "literal_text": "(\\mathsf{U}_{\\mathsf{P}\\mathsf{P}}f)(y)=\\mathbb{E}[f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+}=y]\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\|\\mathsf{U}_{\\perp\\mathsf{P}}f\\|^{2}=\\mathbb{E}\\Var(f(Y_{-})\\mid Y_{+})\\,. (B.9)",
