        "literal_text": "Assume \\beta\\eta\\leq 1, and set \\rho_{\\rm mac}\\coloneqq\\frac{1-\\alpha\\eta}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,,\\hskip 20.00003pt\\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\coloneqq\\sqrt{1-\\rho_{\\rm mac}^{2}}=\\frac{2\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}}{1+\\alpha\\eta}\\,. (B.12) Note that \\gamma_{\\rm gap}\\geq\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{\\alpha\\eta}. Then the following hold.",
        "coverage": "NODE_OR_CONTEXT",
        "boundary": "Bounded source prerequisite or B10/B11 statement; no wholepaper claim"
      }
